  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>y</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>z</mi></math> are&nbsp;in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>.</mo></math>, so</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>z</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>y</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>z</mi></math> are in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>i.e.,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>y</mi></math></p><p>Hence, from&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi></math> either <math> <mrow> <mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow> </math>&nbsp;(rejected) or <math> <mrow> <mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow> </math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>z</mi></math>.</p>",
